# vexp MCP index cache — a 5.9 MB binary DB plus a lock file, regenerated
# on demand. Swept in by a `git add -A` and caught by CI, not locally.
.vexp/

# Isolated SDD / agent worktrees (CIS-C0A083C5 — never share a working tree)
.worktrees/
# Subagent-driven-development scratch (briefs, reports, progress ledger)
.superpowers/
# Claude Code hook runtime state (live turn counters, per-session scratch).
# Machine-local and rewritten every turn, so it is a build artifact rather than
# work product — the DIR-031 exception, as KastTune and SagaMail already treat it.
.claude/
